1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,640
I asked an AI assistant to
build a Star Wars timeline,

2
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,586
from the comics to the games.

3
00:00:05,676 --> 00:00:10,186
I gave it an API key for my timelines.
It learned the file format,

4
00:00:10,236 --> 00:00:12,518
wrote the document, and posted it.

5
00:00:13,666 --> 00:00:17,296
I checked the result: ninety-eight
moments of canon and Legends,

6
00:00:17,346 --> 00:00:19,283
every era on one line.

7
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:24,256
Zoom from thirty-six thousand
years before the Battle of Yavin,

8
00:00:24,306 --> 00:00:26,134
all the way to the films.

9
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:33,736
And the app itself? Built
mostly by AI agents,

10
00:00:33,786 --> 00:00:38,792
Claude and OpenAI's, and reviewed by
a human. It's free and open source.
